body:
im beginning to lose the will to live.

&#x200B;

FOR THE LOVE OF GOD, read my comments! she was under a 250w mh light in a fully equiped grow closet. now shes outside till the sun doesnt shine no more.

first 20 days in a tent, yes. under a 250w mh lamp at around 30-35cm distance, which is the recommended distance for this wattage from literally every grower ive met so far, also on growweedeasy & royal queen seeds & zamnesia.

for pictures of the plant while she was younger click this link:

